* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_dam (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): damage costs in their
* linear form (eqdamage.mod with %DAMAGE% not set: the preparation L11-56, EQ_DAMAGE, EQ_OBJDAM and
* the bounds of VAR_DAM, L135-142; M1.3 change 56, docs/m13-plan.md), added to TIMES_Demo demo12
* (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0):
* - REG1 TOTCO2: a damage cost from 2010 on the net emissions, with a base quantity and a step
*   size share, 3 steps below and 4 above the base, elasticities 1 below and 1.5 above.
* - REG2 TOTCO2: a damage cost on the production of emissions (DAM_ELAST 'N' set), a shift by
*   DAM_ELAST 'N' of the cost curve, 2 steps each side.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
DAM_COST ' '/
REG1.2010.TOTCO2.MEURO05 0.002
REG2.2010.TOTCO2.MEURO05 0.003
/

PARAMETER
DAM_BQTY ' '/
REG1.TOTCO2 60000
REG2.TOTCO2 40000
/

PARAMETER
DAM_ELAST ' '/
REG1.TOTCO2.LO 1
REG1.TOTCO2.UP 1.5
REG2.TOTCO2.LO 1
REG2.TOTCO2.UP 1
REG2.TOTCO2.N 1
/

PARAMETER
DAM_STEP ' '/
REG1.TOTCO2.LO 3
REG1.TOTCO2.UP 4
REG2.TOTCO2.LO 2
REG2.TOTCO2.UP 2
/

PARAMETER
DAM_VOC ' '/
REG1.TOTCO2.N 0.1
REG2.TOTCO2.N 0.2
/
